        "slc_a9efb0693377eee88a79998a661ba0a6e0cb519dc18192fdf54b18e45ed717a7"
      ],
      "text": "The CLI ships install/uninstall commands covering many agent hosts (including claude-code, codex, cursor, droid, copilot-cli), plus `doctor hooks` to check installed wiring and `doctor <host>` for a single integration."
    },
